<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch October producer prices rise 3.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch October producer prices rise 3.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch producer price index (PPI) for manufactured goods rose a provisional 0.5 percent in October from September, giving a 3.2 percent rise year-on-year, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.</p>
</text>
